OL,3,GNEWSAValentine card from Amy Winehouse
OL,4,Ato be auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe item, which is part of a huge
OL,7,Fpackage of rock memorabilia set to go
OL,8,Funder the hammer at Ewbank's in Woking
OL,9,Fon 26 August, has an estimated sale
OL,10,Fprice of up to #4,000.
